WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.450
<v Urban>A gun this size does not defend a wall. It changes the mind of the man approaching it.

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:10.600
<v Loukas Notaras>It changes the mind of the treasurer first.

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:12.450
<v Constantine>What would you require?

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:14.400
<v Urban>Bronze. Powder.
